<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-eshghi-odonata-wing-cells-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Odonata wing cells through deep time — MorphoEval overall 76.0/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-14"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "A data comparison rather than a simulation: the one trait the Hoffmann venation model predicts (cell size set by an inhibition length) is compared on 69 fossil and 394 extant wings from Eshghi et al. 2026, with PBDB ages and Hoffmann et al.'s own segmentations as the extant counterpart. The fossil measurements are reproduced independently from the published drawings (cell counts to a median 0.0 %, median cell length to 3.4 %), which also exposes one table row that does not match its drawing and one swapped pair. Finding: median cell length stays at 0.78–0.99 mm across 150 Myr and a 6x range of wing length; the inhibition length is approximately, not strictly, conserved. Overall 76.0/100 (faithfulness 75.7, reproducibility 76.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit fbbcaf6; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.5.4, scipy 1.16.3, pandas 2.3.3, scikit-image 0.26.0, matplotlib 3.10.7, Pillow 12.0.0. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 70, Morphological realism / specimen match 85, Parameter expressivity 50, Morphometric validation 85, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 70, Reproducibility package 70. Output judged: odonata_fossil_resegmentation.png: rendered output of 2026-eshghi-odonata-wing-cells.py at fbbcaf6, image/png, 286190 B, 1663×1323 px, artifact_sha256 ab6f3b9f89fbcff0ff1fa942915cfcb3736ebde60723489a9ee8d7a39c8a5b38 (sha256 ab6f3b9f89fbcff0ff1fa942915cfcb3736ebde60723489a9ee8d7a39c8a5b38)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add scikit-image to requirements.txt and pin versions for the Python 3.14 environment.",
        "remediation needed: Correct the +3 % mid-line bias by eroding cells by half the measured vein width, or state the authors' convention once their methods text is available.",
        "remediation needed: Read the \"mm\" label with a proper template match so",
        "remediation needed: Report the discrepancies (#7," ;
    pk:hasScore 7.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

